{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/title1.png?t=1744387702\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command a young witch who summons eight mystical guardians to forge an ultimate magic squad! Feel the exhilaration of overwhelming monstrous hordes with tactical swarm strategies! Melee protectors shield you in close combat while ranged allies flood the battlefield with dazzling barrages. Witness eight layers of attack effects converging in explosive synergy, instantly setting the entire battlefield ablaze with magical fury!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/\u6218\u6597\u52a8\u56fe2.gif?t=1744387702\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/shop_title2.png?t=1744387702\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each guardian\u2019s power is shaped by battlefield positioning! Vanguard warriors become living bulwarks to weather enemy assaults, while rearguard spellcasters obliterate foes with arcane brilliance. Dynamically reposition your formation to master multi-layered warfare \u2013 from tank-driven charges to devastating mage bombardments, reshape combat through endless tactical permutations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/\u6218\u6597\u52a8\u56fe1.gif?t=1744387702\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/shop_title3.png?t=1744387702\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ascend duplicate guardians through stellar upgrades or forge celestial evolutions: Mystic Formula: Combine ? Cuddle Bunnies + ? = Lunar Deity Hare summoning colossal moons! With 300+ evolutionary branches, craft your mythic legion and unleash divine power beyond imagination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/\u5408\u6210.gif?t=1744387702\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/shop_title4.png?t=1744387702\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every match brings fresh mystic eggs stocked in the shop! Invest gold to hatch them, with chances to unleash high-tier celestial guardians! Complete the Codex to unlock 150+ wondrous protectors brimming with arcane power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/\u5b75\u86cb.gif?t=1744387702\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630410?t=1744387702","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/5f5e9546fbcbb13c8d30ae3659dbc749312c5ebc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744387702","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/facec51121d5714631a1ab07f9ec29d356bee13a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744387702","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/facec51121d5714631a1ab07f9ec29d356bee13a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744387702","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630410/extras/title1.png?t=1744387702\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Command a young witch who summons eight mystical guardians to forg